    {
        "text": "It's been a long time since we've last seen each other.",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "During this time... you've been teetering on the edge of a cliff.",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.3
    },
    {
        "text": "You may have forgotten who you are, but just remembering your name is enough.",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's time. Don't linger here for too long.",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, you aren't my guest yet, nor should you even be here.",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "She still needs you.",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "December 23rd.",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "You may not remember what this date means to you.",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this will thrust you into peril.",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name"
    },
