    {
        "text": "Medic, how's Doctor doing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, just a moment ago... we were holding hands...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "So why... why is Doctor still not waking up...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya! Don't panic, just calm down first!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... S-sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You always get so flustered when it comes to the doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Amiya, if the worst came to pass... what would you do then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm already mentally prepared for that. We would continue to follow the plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I understand. Anyway, I'll do what you requested.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All right... I appreciate it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "About the Doctor...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, Amiya. All the vital signs are stable now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll do one more inspection, just for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you... Thank you very much!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_016_medic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mhm. Breathing is slightly shallow, but blood pressure is normal. There should be no cause for concern.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Medic"
