        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, Doctor... It's me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's me, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've come to rescue you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "...Who... am I...?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a member of Rhodes Island, just like us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...as well as my partner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the most important person to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor... you don't remember?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "...Can I trust you?;...;I see... Pleased to meet you, Amiya.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. I know this is a bit much to take in right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't expect you to remember everything right away, and I'm not asking you to trust me right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, do you really not remember me at all...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if that's the case... I won't give up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've already sacrificed so much, just to find you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, um, hello.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I, I don't know how to put this, but so many things have changed from before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "That includes me as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, you'll always be the most important person to me, Doctor. No matter what happens, this will never change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's why, please... give me a little more time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "However little it might be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......",
        "values": 1
    },
